{"unit_id":"Owen718__snapgrep#feature-indexed-grep","repo":"Owen718/snapgrep","commit":"5760762aaccecd20641399725bf79b4b33b818bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"snapgrep 的功能「索引代码搜索」：在 DSH 的 grep 工具中用 ripgrep 正则搜索，可限定目录和一个 include glob，并返回文件路径、行号和匹配行；索引不可用或查询无法准确处理时改用 ripgrep。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-plugin.ts:226-299","src/kernel-engine.ts:830-856","src/kernel-engine.ts:1724-1745"]}
